## API reference

`ContextMenu(size:)`, `ContextMenuTrigger`, `ContextMenuContent(side_offset: 2, …)`, `ContextMenuItem`,
`ContextMenuCheckboxItem`, `ContextMenuRadioGroup`, `ContextMenuRadioItem`, `ContextMenuLinkItem`, `ContextMenuGroup`,
`ContextMenuGroupLabel`, `ContextMenuSeparator`, `ContextMenuSub`, `ContextMenuSubTrigger`, `ContextMenuSubContent` - see
[Dropdown Menu](<%= page_path(:dropdown_menu) %>) for their props. Events are prefixed `appica-ui--context-menu:`.

## Accessibility

- The popup is a `role="menu"`; make the trigger focusable (`tabindex: "0"`) so keyboard users can open it with
  Shift+F10 or the context-menu key.
- Focus moves into the menu and returns to where it was when it closes.
